    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\u25b6Synopsis</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The unknown curse that befell me took away everything I cherished\u2014my bright personality, the hobbies I enjoyed, my cheerful academy life, and even... my beloved parents.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Nine years have passed since that fateful day. For the first time, I returned to the ruins of the house where I once lived with my parents.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And there, I encountered three men. Sensing an unusually dangerous atmosphere, I hastily left the place.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But soon after, I discovered a shocking truth. My goodness, those three men were the Heads of the divine organizations! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Besides, the professor who disliked me at the academy suddenly offers to write me a recommendation letter to join one of these divine organizations.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Amid the confusion of these inexplicable events, a thought crossed my mind: If they're the Heads of the divine organizations, maybe they can lift the curse placed upon me. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >So, I made a decision. No matter what it takes, I'll confront them and rid myself of this curse. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\u25b6Characters</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3180610/extras/ef140d80ab54f0a8b4c4bdcc547bc112.avif?t=1744806092\" data-has-big width=800 height=414 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u25b6Uria Mahel</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Head of the Divine Ministry, who helps me without hesitation as I struggle to adapt. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >He appears to be polite and kind-hearted to everyone, even in his top position... But what is this strange sense of unease I feel behind his kindness? </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3180610/extras/a625f88e1b68fdd6a519fd5801125aba.avif?t=1744806092\" data-has-big width=800 height=414 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u25b6Haize Karro</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A maverick who acts solely according to his own will... and yet, he is the Head of the Reaper Corps.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >He\u2019s so impulsive and spontaneous that it\u2019s quite challenging to keep up with his mood. But why does he keep holding me back every time I try to leave?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3180610/extras/d81ddc7082e05579d6746c1afd7ed4ef.avif?t=1744806092\" data-has-big width=800 height=414 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u25b6Ismei Heren</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Head of the Holy Knights, who carries out every action according to strict rules.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >He\u2019s especially harsh with me, often scolding me for my frequent mistakes. It might be better if he just cast me aside, so why does he always try to keep me by his side?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3180610/extras/c09bc89347e39ad0eda92d5650d28d80.avif?t=1744806092\" data-has-big width=800 height=414 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u25b6MC</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An unknown curse took everything from her,\u00a0but she will never be defeated by fate.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\u25b6Voice Cast</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>[VSES Team]</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-MC: Empress Rogue Red</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Uria: Magus Agrippa</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Haize: King of Maggots</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Ismei: Tiberiosity</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Lorel: Yumemi</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Leo: Vamptastic Vtuber</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Schlieffen: AnimilkyVA</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Professor &amp; Extras: Jemi Roka</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\u25b6What you can expect from 'Eternal Glory'</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-'Eternal Glory' is a fantasy otome game in the format of a visual novel. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-After playing through the common prologue, you\u2019ll dive into individual routes and explore the stories of these three men! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-90,000+ words per character. 270,000+ words for the whole game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-30+CGs per character. 90+CGs for the whole game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-25+ hand-drawn backgrounds</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-10+ OSTs.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\u25b6About System</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Each character has an individual route.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-After completing the common prologue, you\u2019ll proceed to the unique story of each character.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Each character\u2019s route consists of approximately 20 chapters, including the prologue.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Apart from the prologue, each chapter will present two dialogue choices. One will raise affection, and the other will lower it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Choosing an affection-up option will turn the chapter\u2019s UI red, while choosing an affection-down option will turn it blue.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Once a story is unlocked, you can revisit it anytime.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u>-Additionally, 'Eternal Glory' features a unique save system.</u><br></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u>-Instead of slots, each chapter has its own quick save/load function, so please keep this in mind.</u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\u25b6What you can expect from Early Access</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-All chapters of Uria\u2019s route are available with Full Voice Acting.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Chapters 1 and 2 of Haize and Ismei\u2019s routes are playable.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\u25b6Synopsis</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The unknown curse that befell me took away everything I cherished\u2014my bright personality, the hobbies I enjoyed, my cheerful academy life, and even... my beloved parents.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Nine years have passed since that fateful day. For the first time, I returned to the ruins of the house where I once lived with my parents.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And there, I encountered three men. Sensing an unusually dangerous atmosphere, I hastily left the place.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But soon after, I discovered a shocking truth. My goodness, those three men were the Heads of the divine organizations! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Besides, the professor who disliked me at the academy suddenly offers to write me a recommendation letter to join one of these divine organizations.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Amid the confusion of these inexplicable events, a thought crossed my mind: If they're the Heads of the divine organizations, maybe they can lift the curse placed upon me. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >So, I made a decision. No matter what it takes, I'll confront them and rid myself of this curse. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\u25b6Characters</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3180610/extras/ef140d80ab54f0a8b4c4bdcc547bc112.avif?t=1744806092\" data-has-big width=800 height=414 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u25b6Uria Mahel</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Head of the Divine Ministry, who helps me without hesitation as I struggle to adapt. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >He appears to be polite and kind-hearted to everyone, even in his top position... But what is this strange sense of unease I feel behind his kindness? </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3180610/extras/a625f88e1b68fdd6a519fd5801125aba.avif?t=1744806092\" data-has-big width=800 height=414 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u25b6Haize Karro</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A maverick who acts solely according to his own will... and yet, he is the Head of the Reaper Corps.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >He\u2019s so impulsive and spontaneous that it\u2019s quite challenging to keep up with his mood. But why does he keep holding me back every time I try to leave?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3180610/extras/d81ddc7082e05579d6746c1afd7ed4ef.avif?t=1744806092\" data-has-big width=800 height=414 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u25b6Ismei Heren</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Head of the Holy Knights, who carries out every action according to strict rules.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >He\u2019s especially harsh with me, often scolding me for my frequent mistakes. It might be better if he just cast me aside, so why does he always try to keep me by his side?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3180610/extras/c09bc89347e39ad0eda92d5650d28d80.avif?t=1744806092\" data-has-big width=800 height=414 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u25b6MC</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An unknown curse took everything from her,\u00a0but she will never be defeated by fate.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\u25b6Voice Cast</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>[VSES Team]</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-MC: Empress Rogue Red</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Uria: Magus Agrippa</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Haize: King of Maggots</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Ismei: Tiberiosity</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Lorel: Yumemi</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Leo: Vamptastic Vtuber</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Schlieffen: AnimilkyVA</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Professor &amp; Extras: Jemi Roka</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\u25b6What you can expect from 'Eternal Glory'</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-'Eternal Glory' is a fantasy otome game in the format of a visual novel. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-After playing through the common prologue, you\u2019ll dive into individual routes and explore the stories of these three men! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-90,000+ words per character. 270,000+ words for the whole game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-30+CGs per character. 90+CGs for the whole game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-25+ hand-drawn backgrounds</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-10+ OSTs.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\u25b6About System</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Each character has an individual route.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-After completing the common prologue, you\u2019ll proceed to the unique story of each character.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Each character\u2019s route consists of approximately 20 chapters, including the prologue.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Apart from the prologue, each chapter will present two dialogue choices. One will raise affection, and the other will lower it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Choosing an affection-up option will turn the chapter\u2019s UI red, while choosing an affection-down option will turn it blue.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Once a story is unlocked, you can revisit it anytime.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u>-Additionally, 'Eternal Glory' features a unique save system.</u><br></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u>-Instead of slots, each chapter has its own quick save/load function, so please keep this in mind.</u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\u25b6What you can expect from Early Access</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-All chapters of Uria\u2019s route are available with Full Voice Acting.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Chapters 1 and 2 of Haize and Ismei\u2019s routes are playable.</p>",
